                <h1 id="parent-fieldname-title" class="documentFirstHeading">
                    Accessibility
                </h1>
            
            
        
                             
                             
   

                             
                                 
                                 
            
                
            
            
        
                             

                             
<div class="newsImageContainer">

    <a href="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/information/differently-abled/leadImage/image_view_fullscreen" id="parent-fieldname-leadImage">
       <img src="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/information/differently-abled/leadImage_mini" alt="Accessibility" title="Accessibility" height="68" width="200" class="newsImage" />
    </a>
    

</div>




                             <div id="content-core">
                                 
    
        
        <div class="" id="parent-fieldname-text">
            <p><span id="docs-internal-guid-c6dbc2d3-7fff-ae55-0bda-ab74ebfa1c0b">
<p dir="ltr" style="height: 1.38;"><span>The castle, except for the prisons and the Lions Tower, is accessible to disabled visitors.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="height: 1.38;"><span>Wheelchairs visitors can access the museum from San Paolo Tower (south-west tower),  which is equipped with lifts to reach the first floor.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="height: 1.38;"><span>The ticket office will provide detailed information and assistance points are available through the visiting path.</span></p>
<div><span><br /></span></div>
</span></p>
<p><img src="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/information/maps/info-differently-abled" alt="Info differently abled" class="image-inline" title="Info differently abled" /><span>Download the route maps for the differently abled: </span></p>
<ul>
<li class="square"><a href="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/it/informazioni/mappe-stampabili/pianta-piano-terra" class="internal-link"><strong><span class="square">Ground floor map </span></strong><span class="square">(pdf - 208 KB)</span></a></li>
<strong> </strong>
<li class="square"><a href="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/it/informazioni/mappe-stampabili/pianta-primo-piano" class="internal-link"><strong><span class="square">First floor map </span></strong><span class="square">(pdf - 208 KB)</span></a></li>
</ul>
<h2 style="text-align: center; ">GROUND FLOOR</h2>
<p style="text-align: center; "><img src="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/information/maps/differently-abled-map-ground-floor" alt="Differently abled map - ground floor" class="image-inline" title="Differently abled map - ground floor" /></p>
<h2 style="text-align: center; ">FIRST FLOOR</h2>
<p style="text-align: center; "><img src="https://www.castelloestense.it/en/information/maps/differently-abled-map-first-floor" alt="Differently abled map - first floor" class="image-inline" title="Differently abled map - first floor" /></p>
            
        </div>
    
    

